# Line-ending policy lives here. Every text file is stored and checked out
# with LF whatever the local core.autocrlf says: without it a Windows checkout
# commits CRLF and a Linux one LF, and the same file reads as wholly rewritten
# depending on who touched it last, which buries the real diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so never touched. Add a `-text` or `binary` entry here for any file
# that must reach the working tree with exactly the bytes the blob holds.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
